fonts/: Inter and JetBrains Mono are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
(see fonts/OFL-Inter.txt and fonts/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt). The bundled files are
static instances (Inter 400/500/600/700 at opsz 14, JetBrains Mono 400/600) of the
upstream variable fonts, subset to Latin + Latin Extended-A, punctuation and symbols.
